                <pb facs="0702" n="620" sameAs="frus:frus1925v02/pg620"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.1718/108: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Thurston</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-01-08T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                                1925—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3. Your 9, January 7, 4 p.m. Please cable full text of note when received. You
                    may inform Solorzano informally that this Government <pb facs="0703" n="621"
                        xml:id="pg621"/> will give note most careful consideration. Inquire whether
                    there is any objection to publication of note.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
